        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Peixe de Lama. Mudkip possui força suficiente para despedaçar grandes rochas. Para descansar, enterra- se na lama do fundo dos rios. Ao usar sua grande nadadeira caudal, ganha velocidade rapidamente na água. Apesar do tamanho pequeno, é muito forte.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Monstro, Água 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Mudkip pode evoluir para Marshtomp no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Rock Smash, Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Mud-Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Foresight</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Supersonic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Bide, Water Pulse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Mud Sport, Rock Slide</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Amnesia, Rock Throw</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Protect, Surf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Screech, Whirlpool</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Hydro Pump</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Endeavor</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Amnesia, Aqua Tail, Attract, Avalanche, Blizzard, Body Slam, Chilling Water, Confide, Curse, Dig, Dive, Double Team, Double-Edge, Earth Power, Echoed Voice, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Frustration, Hail, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Ice Beam, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Liquidation, Low Kick, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Muddy Water, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roar, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Scald, Screech, Sleep Talk, Sludge Wave, Snore, Substitute, Superpower, Surf, Swagger, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Uproar, Water Pledge, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Ancient Power, Avalanche, Barrier, Bite, Counter, Curse, Double-Edge, Ice Ball, Mirror Coat, Mud Bomb, Mud-Slap, Refresh, Sludge, Stomp, Uproar, Whirlpool, Wide Guard, Yawn</p>",
